[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0545","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0545.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1408","title":"Cobalt Qube Webmail 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Cobalt Qube 3 的 WebMail 2.0.1 版本中存在 readmsg.php 文件的目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过 mailbox 参数传入 `../` 路径遍历序列，突破 Web 目录限制读取服务器任意文件。该漏洞影响使用 Cobalt Qube 设备的邮件服务系统，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程利用，严重威胁邮件系统的文件保密性。CVSS 评分 5.0，属于中危级别，攻击者可轻易利用该漏洞获取敏感服务器文件信息。（原文自 NVD 官方描述，融合本地 ExploitDB 实际技术细节）","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1408"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:12Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Cobalt Qube Webmail 至 2.0.1 以上版本（建议升级至最新版本）。若无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器配置中限制 mailbox 参数仅允许字母数字字符，禁止目录遍历字符（../），或在 Web 应用防火墙层面拦截包含目录遍历序列的请求作为临时缓解措施。建议联系 Sun Microsystems（Cobalt 产品线已归属）获取官方补丁包或迁移至现代邮件系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-07/0092.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-08/0245.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6805","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20995","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1408.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1408","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1408.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1408.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2e2ab4687e3840d3ae537224ca3dbe9e3c1067/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h5vm-pcc6-h2f9/GHSA-h5vm-pcc6-h2f9.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1408.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/cobalt_cube_webmail_dir_trav.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x90000/89681/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1408.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0545.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0453","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0453.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1085","title":"Lmail 2.7 临时文件竞争条件漏洞","description":"Lmail 2.7 及更早版本存在临时文件竞争条件漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在目标系统上创建符号链接（symlink）指向任意文件，当 Lmail 在处理临时文件时由于未对文件操作进行原子性检查，攻击者可利用该时间差竞争条件将临时文件重定向至系统任意文件，从而覆盖目标文件内容。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要本地用户权限，成功利用可导致敏感文件被篡改或系统服务异常。","severity":"LOW","score":3.7,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1085"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 Lmail 至 2.7 以上版本，或替换为其他受维护的本地邮件投递代理（如 Postfix 内置的 local delivery 或 procmail）。如无法升级，可临时移除 lmail 的 setuid root 权限（执行 `chmod u-s /usr/bin/lmail`）以消除提权风险，但会限制部分功能。同时避免在多用户环境下使用 lmail 处理临时文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/195022","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2984","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6809","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20992","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1085.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1085","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1085.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1085.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9qcq-874v-xjr4/GHSA-9qcq-874v-xjr4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1085.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c14cbdd1-823f-4e19-977e-206b6f71f801.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0453.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0449","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0449.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1076","title":"Sun Solaris whodo 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris SunOS 5.5.1 至 5.8 版本中的 whodo 工具存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过设置超长的 SOR 或 CFIME 环境变量触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而以当前用户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞需要本地访问权限，无法远程利用，但一旦获得低权限本地访问，即可利用此漏洞提升权限至 root。CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。目前已存在公开的利用代码（ExploitDB 20974），建议用户升级到不受影响的 Solaris 版本或应用厂商补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1076"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-05T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:32Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Solaris SunOS 5.5.1~5.8 系统，Oracle 已不再为这些版本发布安全补丁。建议立即升级到受支持的 Solaris 11.4 或更新版本。如无法升级，可移除 whodo 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/whodo）以消除提权风险，同时严格限制本地用户登录权限，并通过 SOR 和 CFIME 环境变量长度检查脚本作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-07/0076.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2935","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6802","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A34","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A47","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20974","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1076.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1076","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1076.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1076.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wppv-9xfq-qv5x/GHSA-wppv-9xfq-qv5x.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1076.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2935/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--107bf3f3-3226-4240-926b-60ce25f49bed.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1076.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0449.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0492","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0492.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1243","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0/5.0 asp.dll Scripting.FileSystemObject 设备文件拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 和 5.0 的 asp.dll 组件中 Scripting.FileSystemObject 存在拒绝服务漏洞。本地或远程攻击者可通过两种方式利用：一是创建使用 Scripting.FileSystemObject 打开包含 MS-DOS 设备名（如 AUX、CON、NUL 等）文件的 ASP 程序；二是远程向内部使用 Scripting.FileSystemObject 的 ASP 程序注入设备名，导致 IIS 服务崩溃。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程触发，攻击复杂度低，影响 IIS 服务器的可用性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1243"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:52Z","remediation":"升级到 Windows Server 2003 及以上版本（IIS 6.0+），该漏洞已在后续版本修复。如无法升级，在 ASP 应用中过滤 MS-DOS 设备名（CON、NUL、AUX、LPT1 等）作为输入参数，或移除 Scripting.FileSystemObject 组件注册：`regsvr32 -u %windir%\\system32\\scrrun.dll`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6800.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/194919","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2973","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20991","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1243.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1243","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1243.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1243.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-385r-ghm4-jjf9/GHSA-385r-ghm4-jjf9.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/1xxx/cve-2001-1243.yaml","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1243.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--01c8080d-77a1-4890-b36f-37535510b7ef.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0492.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0454","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0454.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1086","title":"XFree86 X11R6 XDM 会话Cookie可猜测漏洞","description":"XFree86 X11R6 3.3 及 3.3.3 版本中的 XDM（X Display Manager）在编译时启用了 HasXdmXauth 选项后，使用 gettimeofday() 生成会话 Cookie，导致 Cookie 值高度可预测。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标 XDM 服务发起暴力破解攻击，通过枚举可能的 Cookie 值获取 X 显示器的未授权访问权限，进而可能控制目标系统的图形界面会话。该漏洞影响 XFree86 3.3 及 3.3.3 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1086"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:33Z","remediation":"升级 XFree86 至 4.0 及以上版本，该版本修复了 XDM cookie 生成算法中的可预测性问题。如无法升级，可禁用 XDM 服务（`/etc/init.d/xdm stop`）或使用 xhost 限制仅允许特定 IP 访问 X 显示，并在网络层面通过防火墙封锁 TCP 端口 6000 以阻止远程 X 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/195008","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/194907","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2985","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6808","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20993","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d426ca16061eaa1a65a39ea953ac0efe02aa4cae/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1086.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1086","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1086.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db2f5eda64b048f89c93b57f05c779b62a05c5c9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1086.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-45vg-36w4-jh4r/GHSA-45vg-36w4-jh4r.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1086.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2985/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151200_151300.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--da6b5160-157b-4044-9fd5-82e8306cda37.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0454.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0448","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0448.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1075","title":"Cobalt RaQ3 PopRelayD SMTP 中继认证绕过漏洞","description":"Cobalt RaQ3 服务器中 poprelayd 脚本（2.0 版本之前）存在 SMTP 中继认证绕过漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 maillog 日志文件中注入包含自身 IP 地址的 \"POP login by user\" 字符串，绕过认证机制并利用该服务器作为开放 SMTP 中继发送垃圾邮件。该漏洞影响 Cobalt RaQ3 系列服务器，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。厂商已发布更新版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1075"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:32Z","remediation":"升级 poprelayd 脚本至 2.0 或更高版本。Cobalt RaQ3 服务器已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的邮件服务器软件，并在邮件服务器上启用 SMTP 认证（SMTP AUTH）及限制中继来源 IP 范围作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-07/0064.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-07/0150.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2986","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6806","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20994","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1075.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1075","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/291c09f8f1fb3b2fa866c7b93e7660471419cef8/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1075.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6cdd862a65f157a01ff9fd42e651329142c691d2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1075.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h78v-2wx7-pqf7/GHSA-h78v-2wx7-pqf7.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1075.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/P/poprelayd_auth.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1075.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9257a30f-3c82-4c98-b159-b7bbcfd5aa70.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0448.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0267","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0267.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0439","title":"licq URL shell元字符命令执行漏洞","description":"licq 是一款 Linux 平台下的 ICQ 即时通讯客户端软件，其 1.0.3 之前版本在处理 URL 时存在命令注入漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含 shell 元字符（如反引号、管道符等）的特制 URL 链接，当 licq 客户端解析并处理该恶意 URL 时，系统会执行嵌入的任意命令，导致攻击者能够在受害者主机上以 licq 进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，可造成信息泄露、系统控制等严重危害。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0439"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:18Z","remediation":"立即将 licq 升级到 1.0.3 或更高版本。各发行版对应操作：Red Hat Linux 用户安装 RHSA-2001-022 或 RHSA-2001-023 提供的更新包；Mandrake Linux 用户安装 MDKSA-2001-032 更新；Conectiva Linux 用户安装公告 000389 更新。如无法升级，可在 licq 配置中禁用 URL 自动解析功能，或在网络层面过滤包含 shell 元字符（如 `;` `|` `` ` `` `$`）的入站 URL 请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2001-04/0607.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000389","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-032.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/5641","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-022.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-023.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6261","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0439.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0439","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0439.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0439.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8wfc-6m4r-hvmp/GHSA-8wfc-6m4r-hvmp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-032.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0439.json","https://github.com/thangnv-0703/RiskManagement/blob/e7c85af6728d1250da4fafda8312c295f4bdbcc2/web/src/pages/risk-assessments/$id/_mock.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0267.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0195","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0195.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0486","title":"Novell BorderManager TCP SYN Flood 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Novell BorderManager 3.6及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标系统的353端口发送大量TCP SYN数据包（SYN Flood攻击），耗尽服务器连接资源，导致服务无法响应正常请求。该漏洞影响Novell BorderManager Enterprise Edition 3.5及3.6版本，CVSS评分5.0，危害等级中等。厂商已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0486"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:23Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Novell BorderManager 至 3.6 以上版本（Novell 已发布 TID#2959062 补丁）。由于该产品已停止技术支持，更推荐在防火墙上配置规则，阻止外部对 TCP 353 端口的访问，仅允许可信 IP 连接。如条件允许，建议迁移至受支持的替代产品以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0000.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2001-q2/0020.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98779821207867&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98865027328391&w=2","http://support.novell.com/cgi-bin/search/searchtid.cgi?/2959062.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2623","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6429","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/264","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0486.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/97700d7e657426c8e1ee6cf44a0a2b88c60738c3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0486.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0486","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/800f04b3cfadd1b9ab0343f5b9acd785dbc1e953/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0486.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0486.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hvv3-ghc7-mq9w/GHSA-hvv3-ghc7-mq9w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0486.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--24232730-d3d9-4626-a8b4-15f119c79905.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0195.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0187","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0187.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0464","title":"CrossWind CyberScheduler websyncd 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CrossWind CyberScheduler 2.1 的 websyncd 组件中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 websync.exe 发送超长的 tzs（时区）参数触发该漏洞，导致目标系统执行任意命令。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，成功利用后可完全控制受影响系统。CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前已存在公开的 ExploitDB 利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0464"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:21Z","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，官方未发布补丁。建议立即停止使用 CrossWind CyberScheduler 2.1，迁移至受支持的调度方案（如 ActiveState 或 Jenkins）。若无法立即替换，可在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面配置规则拦截包含超长 tzs 参数的请求，并在防火墙限制对 websync.cgi 的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98761402029302&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2628","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20780","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0464.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/60bbc98c39201e6f566