iva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000389","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-032.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/5601","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-022.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-023.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6645","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20646","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0440.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0440","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0440.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0440.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v3qr-73f4-xf4g/GHSA-v3qr-73f4-xf4g.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-032.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0440.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0178.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0177","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0177.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0432","title":"Trend Micro Interscan VirusWall 远程管理服务 CGI 程序缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Trend Micro Interscan VirusWall for Linux 3.0.1 远程管理服务的多个 CGI 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向受影响 CGI 程序发送特制请求触发缓冲区溢出，从而以服务进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，影响所有运行 Trend Micro Interscan VirusWall 3.0.1 的 Linux 系统。目前已存在公开的 Exploit-DB 利用代码，攻击者可轻易实施远程代码执行攻击。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0432"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:17Z","remediation":"立即升级 Trend Micro Interscan VirusWall 至 3.0.1 以上已修复版本；如无法升级，在防火墙上严格限制 TCP 端口 1812 的访问来源 IP，仅允许受信任的管理员地址连接远程管理服务，并移除或禁用 /cgi-bin/ 目录下 catinfo 等 CGI 程序。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至 Trend Micro 当前支持的网关防病毒产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0218.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2579","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20750","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0432.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0432","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0432.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0432.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/vw_bof.nasl","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/interscan_vw_cgi.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0432.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2579/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0177.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0176","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0176.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0426","title":"Sun Solaris CDE dtsession 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 7.0/8 及 SGI IRIX 6.5 操作系统的 CDE 桌面环境中的 dtsession 组件存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向 LANG 环境变量传入超长字符串触发缓冲区溢出，从而获取 root 权限。该漏洞源于 dtsession 在处理环境变量时未正确检查边界，导致栈缓冲区溢出。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0426"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:17Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Sun 针对 Solaris 7/8 发布的 CDE dtsession 补丁 (Patch ID 108650-xx 及后续更新)，SGI IRIX 6.5 用户应升级到安装了补丁的 IRIX 6.5.14 或更高版本。临时缓解措施：以 root 执行 `chmod -s /usr/dt/bin/dtsession` 移除 dtsession 的 setuid 位，或限制可登录本地用户的白名单。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0203.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20766","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/528991f6906b29893dd0e43e65862cd92fd607c8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0426.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0426","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0426.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0426.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d8c03b84658bbca948e09e4af723cb11141fb41e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7f96-32pr-5cjh/GHSA-7f96-32pr-5cjh.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0426.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2603/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--954721b1-0649-4e55-8438-fd546f15e0fc.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0176.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0174","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0174.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0423","title":"Sun Solaris ipcs 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 7/8 系统中的 ipcs 命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于未对 TZ（时区）环境变量进行长度检查，本地攻击者可通过设置超长的 TZ 环境变量触发缓冲区溢出，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Solaris 7 x86 及 Solaris 8 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，成功利用后可完全控制目标系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0423"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:16Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Oracle Solaris 11.4 或更高版本（Solaris 7/8 已停止支持，不再提供安全更新）。如无法升级，可设置内核参数 `noexec_user_stack=1` 并限制本地用户登录，同时通过 `tzsetup` 或环境变量过滤脚本限制 TZ 变量长度不超过 256 字节作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0217.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2581","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6369","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20751","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0423.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0423","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0423.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f2c577e1255b2c3fd617b7f1c499a222feb7b668/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0423.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-23p6-gh9w-qhrf/GHSA-23p6-gh9w-qhrf.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0093.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151100_151200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--16ff0e60-2057-4fe7-8559-0eeb536c958a.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0174.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0173","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0173.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0422","title":"Oracle Solaris Xsun HOME 环境变量缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 操作系统中的 Xsun 组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。Xsun 是 Solaris 下的 X Window System 服务器实现，在处理 HOME 环境变量时未正确检查长度边界，本地攻击者可通过设置超长的 HOME 环境变量并触发 Xsun 执行，导致栈缓冲区溢出。攻击者利用此漏洞可覆盖返回地址，以 root 权限执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Solaris 8 及更早版本，需要本地系统访问权限，无需用户交互。已存在公开可利用代码。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0422"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:16Z","remediation":"Solaris 8 用户安装补丁 108652（SPARC）/108653（x86），Solaris 7 安装 106942（SPARC）/106943（x86），Solaris 2.6 安装 105565（SPARC）/105566（x86）。上述版本均已停止支持，建议升级至 Solaris 11。临时缓解措施：限制 Xsun 二进制文件执行权限，仅允许可信用户执行 `/usr/openwin/bin/Xsun`。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-04/0158.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2561","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6343","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A555","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20743","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0422.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0422","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0422.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0422.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6cj3-4wq8-r2m5/GHSA-6cj3-4wq8-r2m5.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c6342b1d-b318-4acc-865c-65c7eddb84ea.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0422.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0173.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0172","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0172.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0421","title":"Sun Solaris FTP 服务器敏感信息泄露漏洞","description":"Solaris 8 及之前版本的 FTP 服务器存在内核转储漏洞。本地或远程攻击者可通过发送包含有效用户名及错误密码的认证请求，随后执行 CWD ~ 命令触发 FTP 服务产生内核转储文件（core dump），该文件默认存储于根目录且权限可能为世界可读。攻击者可借此获取其中包含的 shadow 密码等敏感信息，或填满磁盘分区造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程触发，影响 Solaris 2.6/7/8 等版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0421"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-07-02T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:16Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Sun 安全补丁 110646-01 (Solaris 8) 或 108809-01 (Solaris 2.6)，可通过 sunsolve.sun.com 获取。如无法打补丁，可在 /etc/ftpd/ftpaccess 中限制匿名用户权限，或在 inetd.conf 中注释 ftp 行并重启 inetd 以禁用 FTP 服务作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/177200","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2601","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20764","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0421.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0421","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0421.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0421.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/solaris7_110646.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/db909d46c3d9b98ec1f95daa3c88d7a8990ea8f5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8fjp-x7fp-72f8/GHSA-8fjp-x7fp-72f8.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/solaris8_111606.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0421.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2